'''Ulex parviflorus''' is a species of [[gorse]] [[Native species|native]] to [[France]], the [[Iberian Peninsula]], and parts of the [[Maghreb]].<ref name=POWO>{{cite taxon |powo |id=524339-1 |access-date=2 August 2024 |title=''Ulex parviflorus'' Pourr.}}</ref>

''Ulex parviflorus'' was described by [[Pierre André Pourret]] in 1788.<ref name=IPNI>{{cite taxon |IPNI |title=''Ulex parviflorus'' Pourr. |id=524339-1 |access-date=2 August 2024}}</ref>

